725→## Performance Considerations for Large Datasets
726→
727→### Data Size Guidelines
728→
729→| Data Size | Approach |
730→|---|---|
731→| <1,000 rows | Embed directly in HTML. Full interactivity. |
732→| 1,000 - 10,000 rows | Embed in HTML. May need to pre-aggregate for charts. |
733→| 10,000 - 100,000 rows | Pre-aggregate server-side. Embed only aggregated data. |
734→| >100,000 rows | Not suitable for client-side dashboard. Use a BI tool or paginate. |
735→
736→### Pre-Aggregation Pattern
737→
738→Instead of embedding raw data and aggregating in the browser:
739→
740→```javascript
741→// DON'T: embed 50,000 raw rows
742→const RAW_DATA = [/* 50,000 rows */];
743→
744→// DO: pre-aggregate before embedding
745→const CHART_DATA = {
746→    monthly_revenue: [
747→        { month: '2024-01', revenue: 150000, orders: 1200 },
748→        { month: '2024-02', revenue: 165000, orders: 1350 },
749→        // ... 12 rows instead of 50,000
750→    ],
751→    top_products: [
